<title>SOUTH AFRICA: KILIMANJARO LIFTS YEAR PROFITS, DIV.</title>
<headline>KILIMANJARO LIFTS YEAR PROFITS, DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>Shr, attrib (cts)</p>
<p>    - weighted avge	 22.7	  vs 21.0</p>
<p>    - in issue at yr end  22.7	  vs 18.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)  2.3 making 4.0	   vs 3.5  </p>
<p>    Attrib income	   6.36	  vs 5.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   10.61	 vs 8.57</p>
<p>    Tax			 4.25	  vs 3.17</p>
