<p>    Turnover		  74.13	 vs 63.89</p>
<p>Div payable October 24</p>
<p>on register October 11</p>
<p>Full name: Kilimanjaro Investments Ltd (soft drinks bottler)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was optimistic about future</p>
<p>prospects.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
